"html":"Theorem 11.3, pp. 276–277; scans 284–285"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Theorem 11.3, pp. 276–277; scans 284–285"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\">\\(L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span>。族和商接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"481adbebb0f51a94\" href=\"?note=481adbebb0f51a94\" title=\"73-df-trio-and-full-trio\">73-df-trio-and-full-trio</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"277b77eecf2ab276\" href=\"?note=277b77eecf2ab276\" title=\"73-df-language-quotients\">73-df-language-quotients</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio\\text{-}regular\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nL/R\\in\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio\\text{-}regular\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nL/R\\in\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>把候选词的前段字符加上互异副本标签；一个同态去掉标签，正则交保证未标记后段属于 R，另一个允许擦除的同态删除后段。结果恰为右商。此处 R 的正则性参与有效构造；与“正则 A 对任意 B 取商”那条非有效存在性结论不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-trio-and-full-trio","status":"resolved","id":"481adbebb0f51a94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-trio-and-full-trio]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-quotients","status":"resolved","id":"277b77eecf2ab276","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-language-quotients]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-trio-and-full-trio","status":"resolved","id":"481adbebb0f51a94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)$，$\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A$、$L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)$、$R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$。族和商接口见 [[73-df-trio-and-full-trio]]、[[73-df-language-quotients]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-language-quotients","status":"resolved","id":"277b77eecf2ab276","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)$，$\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A$、$L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)$、$R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}$。族和商接口见 [[73-df-trio-and-full-trio]]、[[73-df-language-quotients]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma\\in\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathcal F\\cap\\mathcal P(\\Sigma^*)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in\\mathsf{REG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}full\\text{-}trio\\text{-}regular\\text{-}quotient}\\vdash\nL/R\\in\\mathcal F","display":true}],"bytes":1764,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-340","locations":["正文"],"count